{"id":"12ca2ea9396c7639","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound.md","title":"Certificate Bound from Sensitivity","display":"thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound — Certificate Bound from Sensitivity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound","aliases":["28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound"],"display":"thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound — Certificate Bound from Sensitivity","depends_on":["[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]","[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]","[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.12 and proof","source_printed_pages":"266","source_pdf_pages":"292","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound — Certificate Bound from Sensitivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" href=\"?note=4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" title=\"28-df-certificate-complexity\">28-df-certificate-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.12 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"266"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"292"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(f)\">\\(C(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" href=\"?note=4f6e59cc4bcadd06\" title=\"28-df-certificate-complexity\">28-df-certificate-complexity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(f),bs(f)\">\\(s(f),bs(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(f)\\le s(f)bs(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(f)\\le s(f)bs(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定x，取达到bs_x的互不交敏感块，再各自缩为包含极小敏感块。对B_i中的每个j，极小性使x^{⊕B_i}在j处敏感，故|B_i|≤s(f)。所有块的并S构成x的证书：若与x在S上相同却值相反，其差异坐标集就是一个与全部B_i不交的新敏感块，矛盾。因此|S|≤s(f)bs_x(f)，再取最坏x。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.12 and proof；印刷页 266；PDF 页 292。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Certificate Bound from Sensitivity，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-certificate-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4f6e59cc4bcadd06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"cff47baaf3aae6af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-block-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-certificate-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4f6e59cc4bcadd06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"cff47baaf3aae6af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-block-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C(f)","display":false},{"tex":"s(f),bs(f)","display":false},{"tex":"C(f)\\le s(f)bs(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1685,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-336","locations":[